```http
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. POST /files/
# Expected status: 200
# Expected response:
# {
#   "file_size": 12
# }

POST {{baseUrl}}/files/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FastAPIFormBoundary

------FastAPIFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello World!
------FastAPIFormBoundary--

### 2. POST /uploadfile/
# Expected status: 200
# Expected response:
# {
#   "filename": "test.txt"
# }

POST {{baseUrl}}/uploadfile/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FastAPIFormBoundary

------FastAPIFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello World!
------FastAPIFormBoundary--
```